= Answer Key

== Part A: Easy

+ $2 "H"_2 + "O"_2 -> 2 "H"_2"O"$
+ $2 "Na" + "Cl"_2 -> 2 "NaCl"$
+ $"Mg" + 2 "HCl" -> "MgCl"_2 + "H"_2$

== Part B: Medium

+ $"CH"_4 + 2 "O"_2 -> "CO"_2 + 2 "H"_2"O"$
+ $4 "Al" + 3 "O"_2 -> 2 "Al"_2"O"_3$
+ $3 "Fe" + 4 "H"_2"O" -> "Fe"_3"O"_4 + 4 "H"_2$

== Part C: Hard

+ $"C"_3"H"_8 + 5 "O"_2 -> 3 "CO"_2 + 4 "H"_2"O"$
+ $3 "Ca"("OH")_2 + 2 "H"_3"PO"_4 -> "Ca"_3("PO"_4)_2 + 6 "H"_2"O"$
+ $2 "KMnO"_4 + 16 "HCl" -> 2 "KCl" + 2 "MnCl"_2 + 8 "H"_2"O" + 5 "Cl"_2$
+ $3 "Cu" + 8 "HNO"_3 -> 3 "Cu"("NO"_3)_2 + 2 "NO" + 4 "H"_2"O"$